==Battleground==
*1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is still easy compared to the first one, as none of the enemies are threatening. Just use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and it should do the job just fine.

